  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RRi5BCA.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1997\" height=\"463\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>RAR-Compat（Relics: Artifacts Compat）重新定義了 Artifacts 模組的機制，將其融入 Relics 更為複雜且多層次的系統中。此擴充套件不再僅僅隨機生成裝備，而是將 Artifacts 的物品轉換為符合 Relics 的深度升級系統，並引入新的細微差異與機制。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7tcUEyB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p>必要依賴項目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RELICS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ARTIFACTS</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JrnT9d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.X:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a></li>\n<li><strong>1.20.1:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rar-compat/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QpQYJLy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><strong>問：這個模組是如何運作？<br></strong>答：RAR-Compat 重新定義了現有 Artifacts 物品的機制以契合 Relics 系統。我們盡可能讓它們接近原版機制，但仍有部分物品必須進行完全改動。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將此模組用於整合包中嗎？</strong><br>答：可以，歡迎加入。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以將此模組重新發布到其他平台嗎？</strong><br>答：不行。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8n9CSxW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/rar-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frar-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frar-compat%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252frar-compat%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRelics%253a%2bArtifacts%2bCompat%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想體驗我們的其它模組嗎？請造訪 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 獲取更多資訊！</strong></p>\n</div>",
